## Original Content
A China-donated smart rehabilitation device was officially handed over and put into use at the Clinical Emergency Hospital in Bishkek, capital of Kyrgyzstan on August 22, 2026.

## Summary
On August 22, 2026, a smart rehabilitation device donated by China was officially handed over and put into use at the Clinical Emergency Hospital in Bishkek, Kyrgyzstan. This event signifies the integration of advanced technology to enhance rehabilitation services in the hospital.

## Key Points
- China donated a smart rehabilitation device to support healthcare in Kyrgyzstan.
- The device was officially handed over at the Clinical Emergency Hospital in Bishkek.
- The device became operational on August 22, 2026, marking its immediate use.
- This initiative highlights the use of smart technology in medical rehabilitation.
- It represents international cooperation and aid in the healthcare sector.


